type: software
title: "acmt001-mcp: Model Context Protocol server for ISO 20022 account management"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server exposing the acmt001 library to AI agents:
  seven tools for discovering ISO 20022 acmt message types, validating
  records and identifiers, looking up LEIs and generating validated
  account management XML.
